    "README.md": "# Hathern Produce - depot dispatch journal\n\nThe depot appends one record to logs/dispatch.jsonl for every lorry it loads:\n`ts` is when the lorry left the yard, `bay` names the loading bay it left from,\n`gross_kg` is the weight the weighbridge showed with the pallets still on board\nand `net_kg` is the weight of the produce alone, the pallets having been weighed\noff first. The journal holds one day of dispatches and is replaced at the end of\nthe day.\n",
